Features:
- Auth (JWT)
- Role-based access
- Projects & Tasks

Tech:
- MERN Stack

Setup:
1. Install backend and frontend dependencies:
   npm run install:all

Backend:
1. Start from the repo root:
   npm run dev

Frontend:
1. Start the React app from the repo root:
   npm run start-frontend

Both together:
1. Start backend and frontend at once:
   npm start

Alternative direct commands:
- cd backend && npm install && npm run dev
- cd frontend && npm install && npm start
